{"key":"enterprise/T1567.004","id":"T1567.004","name":"Exfiltration Over Webhook","domain":"enterprise","level":"subtechnique","parent_id":"T1567","tactics":["exfiltration"],"platforms":["ESXi","Linux","macOS","Office Suite","SaaS","Windows"],"environments":["cloud","cloud-hosted-endpoint","onprem","saas","virtualization"],"environment_basis":"project_taxonomy_from_upstream_platforms","summary":"Adversaries may exfiltrate data to a webhook endpoint rather than over their primary command and control channel. Webhooks are simple mechanisms for allowing a server to push data over HTTP/S to a client without the need for the client to continuously poll the server. Many public and commercial services, such as Discord, Slack, and `webhook.site`, support the creation of webhook endpoints that can be used by other services, such as Github, Jira,…","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1567/004","source_stix_id":"attack-pattern--43f2776f-b4bd-4118-94b8-fee47e69676d","source_modified":"2026-05-12T15:12:00.629Z","source_object_version":"1.2","telemetry":{"status":"mapped","components":[{"id":"DC0038","name":"Application Log Content","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0038","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--9c2fa0ae-7abc-485a-97f6-699e3b6cf9fa","page":"telemetry/DC0038/"},{"id":"DC0064","name":"Command Execution","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0064","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--685f917a-e95e-4ba0-ade1-c7d354dae6e0","page":"telemetry/DC0064/"},{"id":"DC0055","name":"File Access","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0055","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--235b7491-2d2b-4617-9a52-3c0783680f71","page":"telemetry/DC0055/"},{"id":"DC0082","name":"Network Connection Creation","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0082","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--181a9f8c-c780-4f1f-91a8-edb770e904ba","page":"telemetry/DC0082/"},{"id":"DC0085","name":"Network Traffic Content","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0085","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--3772e279-27d6-477a-9fe3-c6beb363594c","page":"telemetry/DC0085/"},{"id":"DC0078","name":"Network Traffic Flow","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0078","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--a7f22107-02e5-4982-9067-6625d4a1765a","page":"telemetry/DC0078/"},{"id":"DC0032","name":"Process Creation","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0032","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--3d20385b-24ef-40e1-9f56-f39750379077","page":"telemetry/DC0032/"}],"strategies":[{"id":"DET0153","name":"Detection Strategy for Exfiltration Over Webhook","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0153","stix_id":"x-mitre-detection-strategy--dcc26ef4-3ecd-4b37-b4b4-66faee084352","relationship_id":"relationship--820a1ffe-27dd-4c0f-a791-f721d5662f5f"}],"analytics":[{"id":"AN0436","name":"Analytic 0436","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0153#AN0436","guidance":"Unusual processes (e.g., powershell.exe, wscript.exe, mshta.exe) posting data to webhook endpoints (Discord, Slack, webhook.site) using HTTP POST/PUT requests. Defender perspective: suspicious process lineage followed by outbound HTTPS traffic to webhook domains.","platforms":["Windows"],"strategy_id":"DET0153"},{"id":"AN0437","name":"Analytic 0437","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0153#AN0437","guidance":"Processes such as curl, wget, or custom scripts initiating POST requests to webhook endpoints with encoded or bulk data. Defender perspective: abnormal chaining of file compression or access followed by outbound data to webhook URLs.","platforms":["Linux"],"strategy_id":"DET0153"},{"id":"AN0438","name":"Analytic 0438","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0153#AN0438","guidance":"Unexpected apps or scripts (osascript, curl, Automator workflows) exfiltrating data via webhooks. Defender perspective: correlation of clipboard/file read operations followed by HTTPS POST traffic to webhook services.","platforms":["macOS"],"strategy_id":"DET0153"},{"id":"AN0439","name":"Analytic 0439","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0153#AN0439","guidance":"VMware services or management daemons generating HTTP POST requests to webhook endpoints, chained with unusual datastore or log access. Defender perspective: exfiltration from VM logs or disk images over webhook URLs.","platforms":["ESXi"],"strategy_id":"DET0153"},{"id":"AN0440","name":"Analytic 0440","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0153#AN0440","guidance":"Suspicious SaaS tenant activity involving webhook configurations pointing to external or untrusted domains. Defender perspective: repeated automated exports or suspicious webhook endpoint registrations.","platforms":["SaaS"],"strategy_id":"DET0153"}],"log_sources":[{"component_id":"DC0032","component":"Process Creation","name":"WinEventLog:Sysmon","channel":"EventCode=1","platforms":["Windows"],"analytic_id":"AN0436","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0153#AN0436","validation":"upstream_definition_not_locally_validated","component_page":"telemetry/DC0032/"},{"component_id":"DC0082","component":"Network Connection Creation","name":"WinEventLog:Sysmon","channel":"EventCode=3, 22","platforms":["Windows"],"analytic_id":"AN0436","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0153#AN0436","validation":"upstream_definition_not_locally_validated","component_page":"telemetry/DC0082/"},{"component_id":"DC0055","component":"File Access","name":"WinEventLog:Security","channel":"EventCode=4663, 4670, 4656","platforms":["Windows"],"analytic_id":"AN0436","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0153#AN0436","validation":"upstream_definition_not_locally_validated","component_page":"telemetry/DC0055/"},{"component_id":"DC0064","component":"Command Execution","name":"auditd:EXECVE","channel":"curl -X POST, wget --post-data","platforms":["Linux"],"analytic_id":"AN0437","source_url":"https://atta